/-!
# Global generation from degree bounds on subcurves

Let `k` be a field and `X` a proper reduced scheme of dimension one over `k`, and let `ℒ` be an
invertible `𝒪_X`-module with `deg(ℒ|_Y) ≥ 2 dim_k H¹(Y, 𝒪_Y)` for every reduced connected closed
subscheme `Y ⊆ X` of dimension one. [Stacks, Tag 0E3F] asserts that `ℒ` is globally generated.
This file proves it when `k` is infinite, from the two consequences of the bound which the proof
uses: `-2 χ(Y, 𝒪_Y) < deg(ℒ|_Y)` and `h¹(Y, 𝒪_Y) < deg(ℒ|_Y) + χ(Y, 𝒪_Y)` for every such `Y`
(both follow from the bound as `h⁰(Y, 𝒪_Y) ≥ 1`). Throughout, "the hypothesis" refers to these two
inequalities.

## Main results

* `AlgebraicGeometry.isZero_cohomologyOverField_one_tensorLeft_closedSubscheme`: under the
  hypothesis, `H¹(X, ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T) = 0` for every closed subset `T` with its reduced structure.
* `AlgebraicGeometry.epi_globalSectionsHom_tensorLeft_closedSubscheme`: under the hypothesis and
  for `k` infinite, `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` is generated by global sections for every closed subset `T`.
* `AlgebraicGeometry.isGeneratedByGlobalSections_of_infinite`: hence `ℒ` is globally generated.

## The argument

Write `𝒪_T` for the structure sheaf of the reduced structure on a closed subset `T`, read on `X`,
and `ℛ_T = ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T`. A nonzero map `ℛ_T ⟶ ω_X` would produce, by
`AlgebraicGeometry.exists_le_invertibleCurveDegree_le_of_ne_zero` with `Z = ∅`, a subcurve `Y`
of `T` with `deg(ℒ|_Y) ≤ -2 χ(Y, 𝒪_Y)`, which the hypothesis excludes; so `H¹(ℛ_T) = 0` by
duality.

Global generation of `ℛ_T` is proved by Noetherian induction on `T`. A zero-dimensional `T` is
handled by [Stacks, Tag 0AYT] and a disconnected one by the splitting `𝒪_T = 𝒪_{T₁} ⊕ 𝒪_{T₂}`.
For `T` connected of dimension one, choose a quotient `ℛ_T ⟶ 𝒬` supported in dimension zero,
nonzero, through whose kernel `ℳ` every global section factors: the cokernel of the global
sections if it is zero-dimensional, and otherwise `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_x` for a closed point `x` on a component
at whose generic point all sections vanish. Then `h¹(ℳ) = h⁰(𝒬)`, and `h⁰(ℳ) = h⁰(ℛ_T) =
deg(ℒ|_T) + χ(𝒪_T) > h¹(𝒪_T)`, so no map `ℳ ⟶ ω_X` is injective, and each vanishes at a generic
point `η` of `T` and kills the part of `ℳ` supported on the component of `η`. Since `k` is
infinite and there are finitely many `η`, a single `η` works for all maps; for the union `T'` of
the other components, `h¹(ℳ)` is then at most `h¹` of the image `ℳ'` of `ℳ` in `ℛ_{T'}`. By
induction `ℛ_{T'}` is globally generated, so `h¹(ℳ') < h⁰(𝒬')` for `𝒬' = ℛ_{T'}/ℳ'` unless
`𝒬' = 0`, while `h⁰(𝒬') ≤ h⁰(𝒬)` since `𝒬 ⟶ 𝒬'` is onto with zero-dimensional kernel. Hence
`h⁰(𝒬) = 0` and `𝒬 = 0`, a contradiction. This is the argument of the source, with the ideal of a
point of the base locus replaced by `ℳ`.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 0E3F](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0E3F)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0E3E](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0E3E)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0BS2](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0BS2)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0AYT](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0AYT)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

open CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits TopologicalSpace

universe u

/-- The closure of `T \ \overline{\{x\}}`: for `x` the generic point of an irreducible component
of `T`, the union of the other components. -/
def TopologicalSpace.Closeds.closureDiffClosure {α : Type*} [TopologicalSpace α] (T : Closeds α)
    (x : α) : Closeds α :=
  ⟨closure ((T : Set α) \ closure {x}), isClosed_closure⟩

/-- The closure of `T \ \overline{\{x\}}` is contained in `T`. -/
theorem TopologicalSpace.Closeds.closureDiffClosure_le {α : Type*} [TopologicalSpace α]
    (T : Closeds α) (x : α) : T.closureDiffClosure x ≤ T :=
  closure_minimal Set.sdiff_subset T.isClosed

namespace AlgebraicGeometry

variable {X : Scheme.{u}}

namespace Scheme.IdealSheafData

/-- The structure sheaf of the empty closed subscheme is zero. -/
theorem isZero_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_top :
    IsZero (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData)) :=
  Scheme.Modules.isZero_of_forall_sections fun U s => by
    have : Subsingleton Γ((⊤ : X.IdealSheafData).subscheme,
      (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData).subschemeι ⁻¹ᵁ U) := inferInstance
    exact Subsingleton.elim (α := Γ((⊤ : X.IdealSheafData).subscheme,
      (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData).subschemeι ⁻¹ᵁ U)) s 0

/-- **The pair of restrictions out of the structure sheaf of a scheme-theoretic union is a
monomorphism**, for `K` the union `I ⊓ J` of `I` and `J`. -/
theorem mono_biprodLift_closedSubschemeRestriction {I J K : X.IdealSheafData} (hI : K ≤ I)
    (hJ : K ≤ J) (h : I ⊓ J ≤ K) :
    Mono (biprod.lift (closedSubschemeRestriction hI) (closedSubschemeRestriction hJ)) := by
  obtain rfl : K = I ⊓ J := le_antisymm (le_inf hI hJ) h
  exact unionToBiprod_mono I J

/-- **The structure sheaf of a disjoint union is the direct sum of the two structure sheaves**:
for `K = I ⊓ J` with `I ⊔ J = ⊤`, the pair of restrictions out of `𝒪_K` is an isomorphism. -/
theorem isIso_biprodLift_closedSubschemeRestriction {I J K : X.IdealSheafData} (hI : K ≤ I)
    (hJ : K ≤ J) (h : I ⊓ J ≤ K) (hIJ : I ⊔ J = ⊤) :
    IsIso (biprod.lift (closedSubschemeRestriction hI) (closedSubschemeRestriction hJ)) := by
  obtain rfl : K = I ⊓ J := le_antisymm (le_inf hI hJ) h
  obtain ⟨hz, hS⟩ := unionIntersection_shortExact I J
  have : Mono (unionToBiprod I J) := unionToBiprod_mono I J
  have hZ : IsZero (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (I ⊔ J)) := by
    rw [hIJ]; exact isZero_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_top
  have : Epi (unionToBiprod I J) := hS.exact.epi_f (hZ.eq_of_tgt _ _)
  exact isIso_of_mono_of_epi (unionToBiprod I J)

end Scheme.IdealSheafData

open Scheme.IdealSheafData

/-! ### Global generation through the map from the free module on all sections -/

/-- The map from the free module on all global sections is natural. -/
theorem exists_globalSectionsHom_comp_eq {F G : X.Modules} (p : F ⟶ G) :
    ∃ g : globalSectionsFree F ⟶ globalSectionsFree G,
      globalSectionsHom F ≫ p = g ≫ globalSectionsHom G := by
  refine ⟨SheafOfModules.freeMap (R := X.ringCatSheaf) (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap p), ?_⟩
  refine (SheafOfModules.freeHomEquiv G).injective (funext fun i => ?_)
  show SheafOfModules.sectionsMap (globalSectionsHom F ≫ p) (SheafOfModules.freeSection i) =
    SheafOfModules.sectionsMap (SheafOfModules.freeMap (R := X.ringCatSheaf)
      (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap p) ≫ globalSectionsHom G) (SheafOfModules.freeSection i)
  refine (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap_comp (globalSectionsHom F) p _).trans ?_
  refine Eq.trans ?_ (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap_comp _ (globalSectionsHom G) _).symm
  refine (congrArg (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap p)
    (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap_freeHomEquiv_symm_freeSection (M := F) id i)).trans ?_
  refine Eq.trans ?_ (congrArg (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap (globalSectionsHom G))
    (SheafOfModules.sectionMap_freeMap_freeSection (R := X.ringCatSheaf)
      (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap p) i)).symm
  exact (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap_freeHomEquiv_symm_freeSection (M := G) id _).symm

/-- A family of generating sections makes the map from the free module on all global sections an
epimorphism. -/
theorem epi_globalSectionsHom_of_generatingSections {F : X.Modules} (σ : F.GeneratingSections) :
    Epi (globalSectionsHom F) := by
  have hσ : Epi (F.freeHomEquiv.symm σ.s) := σ.epi
  have h : SheafOfModules.freeMap (R := X.ringCatSheaf) σ.s ≫ globalSectionsHom F =
      F.freeHomEquiv.symm σ.s := by
    refine (SheafOfModules.freeHomEquiv F).injective (funext fun i => ?_)
    refine Eq.trans ?_
      (congrFun (Equiv.apply_symm_apply (SheafOfModules.freeHomEquiv F) σ.s) i).symm
    show SheafOfModules.sectionsMap (SheafOfModules.freeMap (R := X.ringCatSheaf) σ.s ≫
      globalSectionsHom F) (SheafOfModules.freeSection i) = σ.s i
    refine (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap_comp _ (globalSectionsHom F) _).trans ?_
    refine (congrArg (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap (globalSectionsHom F))
      (SheafOfModules.sectionMap_freeMap_freeSection (R := X.ringCatSheaf) σ.s i)).trans ?_
    exact SheafOfModules.sectionsMap_freeHomEquiv_symm_freeSection (M := F) id _
  have : Epi (SheafOfModules.freeMap (R := X.ringCatSheaf) σ.s ≫ globalSectionsHom F) := by
    rw [h]; exact hσ
  exact epi_of_epi (SheafOfModules.freeMap (R := X.ringCatSheaf) σ.s) (globalSectionsHom F)

/-- Global generation passes to quotients. -/
theorem epi_globalSectionsHom_of_epi {F G : X.Modules} (p : F ⟶ G) [Epi p]
    (hF : Epi (globalSectionsHom F)) : Epi (globalSectionsHom G) := by
  obtain ⟨g, hg⟩ := exists_globalSectionsHom_comp_eq p
  have : Epi (g ≫ globalSectionsHom G) := hg ▸ epi_comp _ _
  exact epi_of_epi g _

/-- **A module receiving a jointly surjective pair of maps from globally generated modules is
globally generated.** -/
theorem epi_globalSectionsHom_of_jointly_epi {A B F : X.Modules} (p : A ⟶ F) (q : B ⟶ F)
    (hA : Epi (globalSectionsHom A)) (hB : Epi (globalSectionsHom B))
    (hpq : ∀ {W : X.Modules} (h : F ⟶ W), p ≫ h = 0 → q ≫ h = 0 → h = 0) :
    Epi (globalSectionsHom F) := by
  refine Preadditive.epi_of_cancel_zero _ fun {W} h hh => hpq h ?_ ?_
  · obtain ⟨g, hg⟩ := exists_globalSectionsHom_comp_eq p
    refine (cancel_epi (globalSectionsHom A)).mp ?_
    rw [comp_zero, ← Category.assoc, hg, Category.assoc, hh, comp_zero]
  · obtain ⟨g, hg⟩ := exists_globalSectionsHom_comp_eq q
    refine (cancel_epi (globalSectionsHom B)).mp ?_
    rw [comp_zero, ← Category.assoc, hg, Category.assoc, hh, comp_zero]

open Opposite in
/-- A morphism killing every global section kills every section of the sheaf of sections. -/
theorem sectionsMap_eq_zero_of_app_top {F G : X.Modules} (g : F ⟶ G)
    (h : ∀ t : Γ(F, ⊤), g.app ⊤ t = 0) (s : F.sections) :
    SheafOfModules.sectionsMap g s = SheafOfModules.sectionsMap (0 : F ⟶ G) s := by
  refine PresheafOfModules.sections_ext _ _ fun U => ?_
  obtain ⟨U⟩ := U
  have hs : s.val (op U) = F.presheaf.map (homOfLE (le_top : U ≤ ⊤)).op (s.val (op ⊤)) :=
    (PresheafOfModules.sections_property s (homOfLE (le_top : U ≤ ⊤)).op).symm
  show g.app U (s.val (op U)) = 0
  rw [hs]
  have hn : g.app U (F.presheaf.map (homOfLE (le_top : U ≤ ⊤)).op (s.val (op ⊤))) =
      G.presheaf.map (homOfLE (le_top : U ≤ ⊤)).op (g.app ⊤ (s.val (op ⊤))) :=
    ConcreteCategory.congr_hom (g.mapPresheaf.naturality (homOfLE (le_top : U ≤ ⊤)).op)
      (s.val (op ⊤))
  rw [hn]
  have h0 : g.app ⊤ (s.val (op ⊤)) = 0 := h _
  rw [h0, map_zero]

/-- **A morphism killing every global section kills the submodule generated by them.** -/
theorem globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero_of_app_top {F G : X.Modules} (g : F ⟶ G)
    (h : ∀ t : Γ(F, ⊤), g.app ⊤ t = 0) : globalSectionsHom F ≫ g = 0 := by
  refine (SheafOfModules.freeHomEquiv G).injective (funext fun i => ?_)
  show SheafOfModules.sectionsMap (globalSectionsHom F ≫ g) (SheafOfModules.freeSection i) =
    SheafOfModules.sectionsMap (0 : globalSectionsFree F ⟶ G) (SheafOfModules.freeSection i)
  refine (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap_comp (globalSectionsHom F) g _).trans ?_
  refine (congrArg (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap g)
    (SheafOfModules.sectionsMap_freeHomEquiv_symm_freeSection (M := F) id i)).trans ?_
  refine (sectionsMap_eq_zero_of_app_top g h i).trans ?_
  refine PresheafOfModules.sections_ext _ _ fun U => ?_
  rfl

/-- **A morphism inducing zero on `H⁰` kills the submodule generated by the global sections.** -/
theorem globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero_of_cohomologyOverFieldMap {k : Type u} [Field k]
    (f : X ⟶ Spec (.of k)) {F G : X.Modules} (g : F ⟶ G)
    (h : ∀ a : cohomologyOverField k f F 0, cohomologyOverFieldMap k f g 0 a = 0) :
    globalSectionsHom F ≫ g = 0 := by
  refine globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero_of_app_top g fun t => ?_
  obtain ⟨a, rfl⟩ := (cohomologyOverFieldZeroEquivSections k f F).surjective t
  have he0 : cohomologyOverFieldZeroEquivSections k f G 0 = 0 := by
    have h1 := cohomologyOverFieldZeroEquivSections_cohomologyOverFieldMap k f (0 : G ⟶ G) 0
    rw [map_zero] at h1
    exact h1.trans rfl
  rw [← cohomologyOverFieldZeroEquivSections_cohomologyOverFieldMap, h, he0]

/-- **A nonzero globally generated module has a nonzero global section.** -/
theorem not_isZero_cohomologyOverField_zero_of_epi {k : Type u} [Field k] (f : X ⟶ Spec (.of k))
    {F : X.Modules} (hF : Epi (globalSectionsHom F)) (hne : ¬ IsZero F) :
    ¬ IsZero (cohomologyOverField k f F 0) := fun h => hne (by
  have hs := ModuleCat.subsingleton_of_isZero h
  have h0 : globalSectionsHom F ≫ 𝟙 F = 0 :=
    globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero_of_cohomologyOverFieldMap f (𝟙 F) fun a => by
      rw [Subsingleton.elim a 0, map_zero]
  rw [Category.comp_id] at h0
  rw [IsZero.iff_id_eq_zero]
  exact (cancel_epi (globalSectionsHom F)).mp (by simp [h0]))

/-! ### Counting with the long exact sequence -/

section Counting

variable {k : Type u} [Field k] (f : X ⟶ Spec (.of k)) [IsProper f]

/-- **`h⁰(𝒬) ≤ h¹(ℳ)` for `0 ⟶ ℳ ⟶ ℛ ⟶ 𝒬 ⟶ 0` when no global section of `ℛ` survives in `𝒬`.** -/
theorem finrank_zero_le_finrank_one_of_shortExact {S : ShortComplex X.Modules} (hS : S.ShortExact)
    (hS₁ : S.X₁.IsCoherent) (h : globalSectionsHom S.X₂ ≫ S.g = 0) :
    Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₃ 0) ≤
      Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₁ 1) := by
  have := finiteDimensional_cohomologyOverField_of_isProper k f S.X₁ 1
  obtain ⟨d, -, -, hgd, -⟩ := exists_cohomologyOverField_longExactSequence k f hS
  refine LinearMap.finrank_le_finrank_of_injective (f := (d 0).hom) fun a b hab => ?_
  have hz : ∀ c, cohomologyOverFieldMap k f S.g 0 c = 0 := fun c =>
    cohomologyOverFieldMap_zero_eq_zero_of_globalSectionsHom_comp f S.g h c
  rw [← sub_eq_zero]
  have : (d 0).hom (a - b) = 0 := by rw [map_sub, hab, sub_self]
  obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ := (hgd 0 (a - b)).mp this
  rw [← hc, hz]

/-- **`H⁰(ℳ) ⟶ H⁰(ℛ)` is onto when no global section of `ℛ` survives in `𝒬`.** -/
theorem finrank_zero_le_finrank_zero_of_shortExact {S : ShortComplex X.Modules}
    (hS : S.ShortExact) (hS₁ : S.X₁.IsCoherent) (h : globalSectionsHom S.X₂ ≫ S.g = 0) :
    Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₂ 0) ≤
      Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₁ 0) := by
  have := finiteDimensional_cohomologyOverField_of_isProper k f S.X₁ 0
  obtain ⟨d, -, hfg, -, -⟩ := exists_cohomologyOverField_longExactSequence k f hS
  refine LinearMap.finrank_le_finrank_of_surjective (f := (cohomologyOverFieldMap k f S.f 0).hom)
    fun b => (hfg 0 b).mp ?_
  exact cohomologyOverFieldMap_zero_eq_zero_of_globalSectionsHom_comp f S.g h b

/-- **`h¹(ℳ) ≤ h⁰(𝒬)` for `0 ⟶ ℳ ⟶ ℛ ⟶ 𝒬 ⟶ 0` when `H¹(ℛ) = 0`, strictly when moreover `ℛ`
is globally generated and `𝒬 ≠ 0`**: some global section of `ℛ` survives in `𝒬`. -/
theorem finrank_one_le_finrank_zero_of_shortExact {S : ShortComplex X.Modules}
    (hS : S.ShortExact) (hS₃ : S.X₃.IsCoherent) (h1 : IsZero (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₂ 1)) :
    Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₁ 1) ≤
        Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₃ 0) ∧
      (Epi (globalSectionsHom S.X₂) → ¬ IsZero S.X₃ →
        Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₁ 1) <
          Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₃ 0)) := by
  have := finiteDimensional_cohomologyOverField_of_isProper k f S.X₃ 0
  obtain ⟨d, -, -, hgd, hdf⟩ := exists_cohomologyOverField_longExactSequence k f hS
  have hsurj : Function.Surjective (d 0).hom := fun b =>
    (hdf 0 b).mp (@Subsingleton.elim _ (ModuleCat.subsingleton_of_isZero h1) _ _)
  have hrk := LinearMap.finrank_range_add_finrank_ker (d 0).hom
  rw [LinearMap.range_eq_top.mpr hsurj, finrank_top] at hrk
  have hrk' : Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₁ 1) +
      Module.finrank k (LinearMap.ker (d 0).hom) =
        Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f S.X₃ 0) := hrk
  refine ⟨by omega, fun hR hQ => ?_⟩
  have hS3 : Epi S.g := hS.epi_g
  have hne : (globalSectionsHom S.X₂ ≫ S.g) ≠ 0 := fun h0 => hQ (by
    have : Epi (globalSectionsHom S.X₂ ≫ S.g) := epi_comp _ _
    rw [IsZero.iff_id_eq_zero]
    exact (cancel_epi (globalSectionsHom S.X₂ ≫ S.g)).mp (by rw [h0, zero_comp, comp_zero]))
  obtain ⟨a, ha⟩ : ∃ a, cohomologyOverFieldMap k f S.g 0 a ≠ 0 := by
    by_contra hcon
    push Not at hcon
    exact hne (globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero_of_cohomologyOverFieldMap f S.g hcon)
  have hker : 0 < Module.finrank k (LinearMap.ker (d 0).hom) := by
    refine Module.finrank_pos_iff_exists_ne_zero.mpr ⟨⟨_, (hgd 0 _).mpr ⟨a, rfl⟩⟩, ?_⟩
    exact fun h0 => ha (congrArg Subtype.val h0)
  omega

/-- **An epimorphism between coherent modules supported in dimension zero is onto on `H⁰`.** -/
theorem finrank_zero_le_of_epi_of_supp_le_zero {Q Q' : X.Modules} (hQc : Q.IsCoherent)
    (hQ'c : Q'.IsCoherent) (p : Q ⟶ Q') [Epi p]
    (hQ : topologicalKrullDim (_root_.SheafOfModules.supp Q) ≤ 0) :
    Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f Q' 0) ≤
      Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f Q 0) := by
  have : IsLocallyNoetherian X := LocallyOfFiniteType.isLocallyNoetherian f
  have := finiteDimensional_cohomologyOverField_of_isProper k f Q 0
  have hS := ShortComplex.shortExact_mk_kernel_ι p
  have : Q.IsQuasicoherent := isQuasicoherent_of_isCoherent Q
  have : Q'.IsQuasicoherent := isQuasicoherent_of_isCoherent Q'
  have : (kernel p).IsQuasicoherent :=
    Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.QcohLimits.isQuasicoherent_kernel p
  have hK : (kernel p).IsCoherent :=
    Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.CoherentOfFiniteType.isCoherent_of_mono_of_isQuasicoherent ‹_›
      (kernel.ι p)
  have hKd : topologicalKrullDim (_root_.SheafOfModules.supp (kernel p)) ≤ 0 :=
    ((Topology.IsEmbedding.inclusion (supp_subset_of_mono (kernel.ι p))).isInducing
      |>.topologicalKrullDim_le).trans hQ
  have h1 := isZero_cohomologyOverField_of_topologicalKrullDim_supp_le_zero k f (kernel p) hKd 1
    Nat.one_pos
  obtain ⟨d, -, -, hgd, hdf⟩ := exists_cohomologyOverField_longExactSequence k f hS
  refine LinearMap.finrank_le_finrank_of_surjective
    (f := (cohomologyOverFieldMap k f p 0).hom) fun b => (hgd 0 b).mp ?_
  exact @Subsingleton.elim _ (ModuleCat.subsingleton_of_isZero h1) _ _

end Counting

/-! ### Maps out of submodules of `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` -/

/-- The twist by an invertible module is an equivalence. -/
private theorem isEquivalence_tensorLeft_of_isInvertible (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] :
    (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).IsEquivalence :=
  (Stacks.SheafOfModules.isInvertible_iff_tensorLeftFunctor_isEquivalence _ _ L).mp hL

/-- Two nonzero lengths cannot fit in a length at most one. -/
private theorem false_of_ne_zero_add_le_one {a b : ℕ∞} (ha : a ≠ 0) (hb : b ≠ 0) (h : a + b ≤ 1) :
    False :=
  absurd ((add_le_add (Order.one_le_iff_ne_zero.mpr ha) (Order.one_le_iff_ne_zero.mpr hb)).trans h)
    (by decide)

/-- The reduced structure on a closed set `T` maps into `T`. -/
private theorem subschemeι_mem_of_vanishingIdeal {T : Closeds X}
    (y : (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme) :
    (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y ∈ (T : Set X) := by
  have : (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y ∈ Set.range (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι := ⟨y, rfl⟩
  rwa [range_subschemeι, coe_support_vanishingIdeal] at this

/-- The support of `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` lies in `T`. -/
private theorem supp_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_subset (L : X.Modules)
    [SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (T : Closeds X) :
    _root_.SheafOfModules.supp ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
      (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) ⊆ T := fun x hx => by
  by_contra hxT
  refine notMem_supp_tensorSheaf_of_notMem L _ ?_ hx
  rw [supp_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf, coe_support_vanishingIdeal]
  exact hxT

/-- Every section of a zero module vanishes. -/
private theorem section_eq_zero_of_isZero {F : X.Modules} (h : IsZero F) {U : X.Opens}
    (s : F.presheaf.obj (Opposite.op U)) : s = 0 := by
  have := congrArg (fun g : F ⟶ F => g.app U s) (h.eq_of_src (𝟙 F) 0)
  simpa using this

/-- The image of a composite has stalks no longer than those of the image of its first factor. -/
theorem length_stalk_image_comp_le_left {A B C : X.Modules} (f : A ⟶ B) (g : B ⟶ C) (x : X) :
    Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk x) ((Abelian.image (f ≫ g)).presheaf.stalk x) ≤
      Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk x) ((Abelian.image f).presheaf.stalk x) := by
  have h : f ≫ g = Abelian.factorThruImage f ≫ (Abelian.image.ι f ≫ g) := by
    rw [← Category.assoc, Abelian.image.fac]
  rw [length_stalk_image_congr h x]
  exact (length_stalk_image_comp_le _ _ x).trans (length_stalk_image_le_source _ x)

/-- **A non-injective map out of a submodule of `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` vanishes at a generic point of `T`**,
for `ℒ` invertible and `𝒪_T` the structure sheaf of the reduced structure on a closed set `T`.
Twisted by `ℒ^{-1}` the source becomes a submodule of `𝒪_T`, whose stalk at a generic point `η`
of `T` has length at most one; the kernel, a nonzero submodule of `𝒪_T`, is nonzero at some `η`,
where the image therefore vanishes, and twisting back does not enlarge the support. -/
theorem exists_mem_genericPoints_notMem_supp_image (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (T : Closeds X)
    {M ω : X.Modules}
    (j : M ⟶ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))
    [Mono j] (φ : M ⟶ ω) (hφ : ¬ Mono φ) :
    ∃ y ∈ genericPoints (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme,
      (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y ∉ _root_.SheafOfModules.supp (Abelian.image φ) := by
  have := isEquivalence_tensorLeft_of_isInvertible L
  let E := (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).asEquivalence
  let G := E.inverse
  let u := E.unitIso.inv.app (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))
  let j' : G.obj M ⟶ closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T) := G.map j ≫ u
  have : G.PreservesMonomorphisms := Functor.preservesMonomorphisms_of_adjunction E.toAdjunction
  have : Mono j' := mono_comp' (G.map_mono j)
    (IsIso.mono_of_iso (E.unitIso.app (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))).symm.hom)
  have hK : ¬ IsZero (G.obj (kernel φ)) := fun h =>
    hφ (Preadditive.mono_of_kernel_zero ((((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map_isZero h).of_iso
      (E.counitIso.app (kernel φ)).symm).eq_of_src _ _))
  obtain ⟨y, hy, hsupp⟩ := Scheme.IdealSheafData.exists_mem_genericPoints_mem_supp
    (vanishingIdeal T) (G.map (kernel.ι φ) ≫ j') hK
  refine ⟨y, hy, fun hη => ?_⟩
  generalize hηe : (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y = η at hη hsupp
  have hC1 : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η) ((G.obj M).presheaf.stalk η) ≤ 1 := by
    refine (length_stalk_le_of_mono j' η).trans ?_
    rw [← hηe]
    exact (Scheme.IdealSheafData.length_stalk_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_of_mem_genericPoints
      (vanishingIdeal T) hy).le
  have hl : G.map (kernel.ι φ) ≫ G.map φ = 0 := by
    rw [← G.map_comp, kernel.condition, Functor.map_zero]
  have : Mono (kernel.lift (G.map φ) (G.map (kernel.ι φ)) hl) :=
    mono_of_mono_fac (kernel.lift_ι _ _ hl)
  have hK1 : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η) ((kernel (G.map φ)).presheaf.stalk η) ≠ 0 :=
    fun h0 => (length_stalk_eq_zero_iff _ η).mp (le_antisymm
      ((length_stalk_le_of_mono (kernel.lift _ _ hl) η).trans h0.le) bot_le) hsupp
  have hψ0 : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η)
      ((Abelian.image (G.map φ)).presheaf.stalk η) = 0 := by
    have hsum := length_stalk_eq_kernel_add_image (G.map φ) η
    by_contra hne
    exact false_of_ne_zero_add_le_one hK1 hne (hsum ▸ hC1)
  have hηim : η ∉ _root_.SheafOfModules.supp (Abelian.image (G.map φ)) :=
    (length_stalk_eq_zero_iff _ η).mp hψ0
  -- Twisting back.
  let ψ : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (G.obj M) ⟶ ω :=
    (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (G.map φ) ≫ E.counitIso.hom.app ω
  have hnat : ψ = E.counitIso.hom.app M ≫ φ := E.counitIso.hom.naturality φ
  have hfac : φ = E.counitIso.inv.app M ≫ ψ := by
    rw [hnat, ← Category.assoc, Iso.inv_hom_id_app, Category.id_comp]
  have hsplit : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (G.map φ) =
      (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (Abelian.factorThruImage (G.map φ)) ≫
        (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (Abelian.image.ι (G.map φ)) := by
    rw [← Functor.map_comp, Abelian.image.fac]
  have hA : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η) ((Abelian.image
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (G.map φ))).presheaf.stalk η) = 0 := by
    refine le_antisymm ?_ bot_le
    rw [length_stalk_image_congr hsplit η]
    refine (length_stalk_image_comp_le_left _ _ η).trans
      ((length_stalk_le_of_mono (Abelian.image.ι _) η).trans (le_of_eq ?_))
    exact (length_stalk_eq_zero_iff _ η).mpr
      (notMem_supp_tensorSheaf_of_notMem L (Abelian.image (G.map φ)) hηim)
  have hB : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η) ((Abelian.image ψ).presheaf.stalk η) = 0 :=
    le_antisymm ((length_stalk_image_comp_le_left _ _ η).trans hA.le) bot_le
  have h0 : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η) ((Abelian.image φ).presheaf.stalk η) = 0 := by
    refine le_antisymm ?_ bot_le
    rw [length_stalk_image_congr hfac η]
    exact (length_stalk_image_comp_le _ _ η).trans hB.le
  exact (length_stalk_eq_zero_iff _ η).mp h0 hη

/-- **The part of a submodule `ℳ ⊆ ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` dying on `T'` embeds into `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_C`** when
`T = C ∪ T'`: the restrictions `𝒪_T ⟶ 𝒪_C ⊕ 𝒪_{T'}` form a monomorphism. -/
theorem mono_kernel_ι_comp_tensorLeft_map_restriction (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] {T C T' : Closeds X}
    (hC : C ≤ T) (hT' : T' ≤ T) (hT : T ≤ C ⊔ T') {M : X.Modules}
    (j : M ⟶ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))
    [Mono j] :
    Mono (kernel.ι (j ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map
        (closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hT'))) ≫ j ≫
      (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map
        (closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hC))) := by
  have := isEquivalence_tensorLeft_of_isInvertible L
  have : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).Additive := Functor.additive_of_preserves_binary_products _
  let rC := closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hC)
  let rT' := closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hT')
  have hlift : Mono (biprod.lift rC rT') := mono_biprodLift_closedSubschemeRestriction _ _
    (by rw [← vanishingIdeal_sup]; exact vanishingIdeal_antimono hT)
  have hLlift : Mono ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (biprod.lift rC rT')) :=
    Functor.map_mono _ _
  have e : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (biprod.lift rC rT') =
      (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map rC ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map biprod.inl +
        (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map rT' ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map biprod.inr := by
    rw [biprod.lift_eq, Functor.map_add, Functor.map_comp, Functor.map_comp]
  refine Preadditive.mono_of_cancel_zero _ fun {W} g hg => ?_
  set ι := kernel.ι (j ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map rT')
  have h2 : (g ≫ ι ≫ j) ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map rT' = 0 := by
    have : ι ≫ j ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map rT' = 0 := kernel.condition _
    simp only [Category.assoc, this, comp_zero]
  have hg' : (g ≫ ι ≫ j) ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map rC = 0 := by
    simpa only [Category.assoc] using hg
  have h3 : (g ≫ ι ≫ j) ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (biprod.lift rC rT') = 0 := by
    rw [e, Preadditive.comp_add, ← Category.assoc, hg', ← Category.assoc, h2, zero_comp,
      zero_comp, add_zero]
  have h4 : g ≫ ι ≫ j = 0 := (cancel_mono _).mp (h3.trans zero_comp.symm)
  have h5 : g ≫ ι = 0 := (cancel_mono j).mp (by rw [Category.assoc, h4, zero_comp])
  exact (cancel_mono ι).mp (by rw [h5, zero_comp])

/-- **A map from a coherent submodule `ℳ ⊆ ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` to `ω_X` vanishing at a point `η` of `T`
kills the part of `ℳ` supported on `\overline{\{η\}}`**, that is the kernel of
`ℳ ⟶ ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_{T'}` for `T'` the closure of `T \ \overline{\{η\}}`. That kernel embeds into
`ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_C` for `C = \overline{\{η\}}`, so its image in `ω_X` is supported in `C` away from `η`,
hence in dimension zero, and vanishes by duality. -/
theorem kernel_ι_comp_eq_zero_of_notMem_supp_image {k : Type u} [Field k]
    (f : X ⟶ Spec (.of k)) [IsProper f] (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1) (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (T : Closeds X) {η : X}
    (hηT : η ∈ (T : Set X)) {M : X.Modules} (hM : M.IsCoherent)
    (j : M ⟶ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))
    [Mono j] (φ : M ⟶ Stacks.Duality.dualizingSheafOverField f)
    (hη : η ∉ _root_.SheafOfModules.supp (Abelian.image φ)) :
    kernel.ι (j ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (closedSubschemeRestriction
      (vanishingIdeal_antimono (T.closureDiffClosure_le η)))) ≫ φ = 0 := by
  have : IsLocallyNoetherian X := LocallyOfFiniteType.isLocallyNoetherian f
  have : IsNoetherian X := isNoetherian_of_locallyOfFiniteType f
  have hLc : L.IsCoherent := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.CoherentKernel.isCoherent_of_isInvertible X L
  let C : Closeds X := ⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩
  have hCT : C ≤ T := closure_minimal (Set.singleton_subset_iff.mpr hηT) T.isClosed
  have hTsup : T ≤ C ⊔ T.closureDiffClosure η := fun x hx =>
    (em (x ∈ closure {η})).elim Or.inl fun hxC => Or.inr (subset_closure ⟨hx, hxC⟩)
  let rC := closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hCT)
  let ρ := j ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (closedSubschemeRestriction
      (vanishingIdeal_antimono (T.closureDiffClosure_le η)))
  have hmono : Mono (kernel.ι ρ ≫ j ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map rC) :=
    mono_kernel_ι_comp_tensorLeft_map_restriction L hCT (T.closureDiffClosure_le η) hTsup j
  have hsubC : _root_.SheafOfModules.supp (Abelian.image (kernel.ι ρ ≫ φ)) ⊆ closure {η} := by
    refine (Stacks.Chow.supp_subset_of_epi (Abelian.factorThruImage _)).trans ?_
    exact (supp_subset_of_mono (kernel.ι ρ ≫ j ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map rC)).trans
      (supp_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_subset L C)
  have hηS : η ∉ _root_.SheafOfModules.supp (Abelian.image (kernel.ι ρ ≫ φ)) := by
    refine (length_stalk_eq_zero_iff _ η).mp (le_antisymm ?_ bot_le)
    exact (length_stalk_image_comp_le _ _ η).trans ((length_stalk_eq_zero_iff _ η).mpr hη).le
  have hRc : ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
      (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal (T.closureDiffClosure η)))).IsCoherent :=
    @SheafOfModules.tensorSheaf_isCoherent X.toRingedSpace L _ hLc
      (isCoherent_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf _)
  have hKc : (kernel ρ).IsCoherent :=
    Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProperMapping.isCoherent_kernel_modules hM hRc ρ
  have hft : (Abelian.image (kernel.ι ρ ≫ φ)).IsFiniteType :=
    @Stacks.SheafOfModules.isFiniteType_of_epi'.{u} _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _
      (Abelian.factorThruImage (kernel.ι ρ ≫ φ)) hKc.isFiniteType
      (inferInstance : Epi (Abelian.factorThruImage (kernel.ι ρ ≫ φ)))
  have hcl : IsClosed (_root_.SheafOfModules.supp (Abelian.image (kernel.ι ρ ≫ φ))) :=
    @_root_.SheafOfModules.isClosed_supp _ _ _ hft
  have hnd : IsNowhereDense (_root_.SheafOfModules.supp (Abelian.image (kernel.ι ρ ≫ φ))) := by
    rw [hcl.isNowhereDense_iff_forall_irreducibleComponents_not_subset]
    intro D hD hDS
    have hDC : D ⊆ closure {η} := hDS.trans hsubC
    have hCD : closure {η} ⊆ D := hD.2 isIrreducible_singleton.closure hDC
    exact hηS (hDS (hCD (subset_closure rfl)))
  exact Stacks.Duality.noZeroDimensionalImages_dualizingSheafOverField f hdim _ hKc
    (kernel.ι ρ ≫ φ) (hnd.topologicalKrullDim_nonpos_of_le_one hcl hdim)

/-- **A non-injective map from a coherent submodule `ℳ ⊆ ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` to `ω_X` kills the part of `ℳ`
supported on one irreducible component of `T`**: the component through a generic point of `T`
at which the map vanishes (`AlgebraicGeometry.exists_mem_genericPoints_notMem_supp_image`). -/
theorem exists_mem_genericPoints_kernel_ι_comp_eq_zero {k : Type u} [Field k]
    (f : X ⟶ Spec (.of k)) [IsProper f] (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1) (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (T : Closeds X)
    {M : X.Modules} (hM : M.IsCoherent)
    (j : M ⟶ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))
    [Mono j] (φ : M ⟶ Stacks.Duality.dualizingSheafOverField f) (hφ : ¬ Mono φ) :
    ∃ y : genericPoints (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme,
      kernel.ι (j ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (closedSubschemeRestriction
        (vanishingIdeal_antimono (T.closureDiffClosure_le ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y.1))))) ≫
        φ = 0 := by
  obtain ⟨y, hy, hη⟩ := exists_mem_genericPoints_notMem_supp_image L T j φ hφ
  have hηT := subschemeι_mem_of_vanishingIdeal y
  exact ⟨⟨y, hy⟩, kernel_ι_comp_eq_zero_of_notMem_supp_image f hdim L T
    (η := (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι (⟨y, hy⟩ : genericPoints (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme).1)
    hηT hM j φ hη⟩

/-- **Over an infinite field, a finite family of maps one of which kills each `φ` contains one
which kills every `φ`**: the `φ` killed by a given member form a subspace, and a vector space over
an infinite field is not a finite union of proper subspaces. -/
theorem exists_forall_comp_eq_zero_of_forall_exists {k : Type u} [Field k] [Infinite k]
    (f : X ⟶ Spec (.of k)) {ι : Type*} [Finite ι] {M ω : X.Modules} {K : ι → X.Modules}
    (g : ∀ i, K i ⟶ M) (h : ∀ φ : M ⟶ ω, ∃ i, g i ≫ φ = 0) : ∃ i, ∀ φ : M ⟶ ω, g i ≫ φ = 0 := by
  let := modulesLinearOverField k f
  let V : ι → Submodule k (M ⟶ ω) := fun i => LinearMap.ker (Linear.leftComp k ω (g i))
  by_contra hne
  push Not at hne
  have hV : ∀ i, V i ≠ ⊤ := fun i htop => by
    obtain ⟨φ, hφ⟩ := hne i
    have : φ ∈ V i := by rw [htop]; exact Submodule.mem_top
    exact hφ (LinearMap.mem_ker.mp this)
  obtain ⟨φ, hφ⟩ := Submodule.exists_forall_notMem_of_forall_ne_top V hV
  obtain ⟨i, hi⟩ := h φ
  exact hφ i (LinearMap.mem_ker.mpr hi)

/-! ### Maps vanishing at the generic point of a component -/

/-- Every generic point of the reduced structure on `\overline{\{η\}}` lies over `η`. -/
theorem subschemeι_eq_of_mem_genericPoints {η : X}
    {y : (vanishingIdeal (⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ : Closeds X)).subscheme}
    (hy : y ∈ genericPoints _) :
    (vanishingIdeal (⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ : Closeds X)).subschemeι y = η := by
  have hηr : η ∈ Set.range
      (vanishingIdeal (⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ : Closeds X)).subschemeι := by
    rw [range_subschemeι, coe_support_vanishingIdeal]
    exact subset_closure rfl
  obtain ⟨z, hz⟩ := hηr
  have hyC := subschemeι_mem_of_vanishingIdeal y
  have hzy : z ⤳ y := by
    rw [← (vanishingIdeal (⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ :
      Closeds X)).subschemeι.isClosedEmbedding.isInducing.specializes_iff, hz]
    exact specializes_iff_mem_closure.mpr hyC
  have hsub : closure {y} ⊆ closure {z} :=
    closure_minimal (Set.singleton_subset_iff.mpr (specializes_iff_mem_closure.mp hzy))
      isClosed_closure
  have heq : closure {y} = closure {z} := (hy.eq_of_ge isIrreducible_singleton.closure hsub).symm
  have hyz : y ⤳ z := specializes_iff_mem_closure.mpr (heq ▸ subset_closure rfl)
  rw [← (hzy.antisymm hyz).eq, hz]

/-- **A closed set `S ⊆ T` of positive dimension contains a generic point of `T`**, for `X` of
dimension at most one: otherwise its preimage in the reduced structure on `T` contains no
irreducible component, hence is nowhere dense, hence of dimension at most zero. -/
theorem exists_mem_genericPoints_subschemeι_mem [NoetherianSpace X]
    (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1) (T : Closeds X) {S : Set X} (hS : IsClosed S) (hST : S ⊆ T)
    (hd : ¬ topologicalKrullDim S ≤ 0) :
    ∃ y ∈ genericPoints (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme, (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y ∈ S := by
  by_contra h
  push Not at h
  have : NoetherianSpace (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme :=
    (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι.isClosedEmbedding.isInducing.noetherianSpace
  have hS'c : IsClosed ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ⁻¹' S) :=
    hS.preimage (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι.continuous
  have hdimY : topologicalKrullDim (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme ≤ 1 :=
    (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι.isClosedEmbedding.isInducing.topologicalKrullDim_le.trans hdim
  have hnd : IsNowhereDense ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ⁻¹' S) := by
    rw [hS'c.isNowhereDense_iff_forall_irreducibleComponents_not_subset]
    intro D hD hDS
    have hDc : IsClosed D := isClosed_of_mem_irreducibleComponents D hD
    have hgen := hD.1.isGenericPoint_genericPoint hDc
    have hmem : hD.1.genericPoint ∈ genericPoints (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme := by
      show closure {hD.1.genericPoint} ∈ irreducibleComponents _
      rw [hgen.def]
      exact hD
    exact h _ hmem (hDS hgen.mem)
  apply hd
  have hsurj : Function.Surjective (S.restrictPreimage (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι) := by
    rintro ⟨x, hx⟩
    have : x ∈ Set.range (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι := by
      rw [range_subschemeι, coe_support_vanishingIdeal]
      exact hST hx
    obtain ⟨y, rfl⟩ := this
    exact ⟨⟨y, hx⟩, rfl⟩
  have hhom : IsHomeomorph (S.restrictPreimage (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι) :=
    isHomeomorph_iff_isEmbedding_surjective.mpr
      ⟨((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι.isClosedEmbedding.restrictPreimage S).isEmbedding, hsurj⟩
  rw [← hhom.topologicalKrullDim_eq]
  exact hnd.topologicalKrullDim_nonpos_of_le_one hS'c hdimY

set_option maxHeartbeats 400000 in
/-- **A map into `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` which dies in a quotient `𝒬` vanishes on the component of a generic
point `η` of `T` in the support of `𝒬`.** At `η` the stalk of `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` is a line, which `𝒬`
does not kill, so the image of the map vanishes at `η`; twisted by `ℒ^{-1}` its restriction to
`C = \overline{\{η\}}` is a submodule of `𝒪_C` vanishing at the only generic point of `C`, hence
zero. -/
theorem comp_tensorLeft_map_restriction_eq_zero (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (T : Closeds X)
    {y : (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme} (hy : y ∈ genericPoints (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme)
    {η : X} (hyη : (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y = η)
    (hC : (⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ : Closeds X) ≤ T) {Q A : X.Modules}
    (π : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)) ⟶ Q)
    [Epi π] (hη : η ∈ _root_.SheafOfModules.supp Q)
    (g : A ⟶ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))
    (hg : g ≫ π = 0) :
    g ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hC))
      = 0 := by
  have := isEquivalence_tensorLeft_of_isInvertible L
  let E := (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).asEquivalence
  let G := E.inverse
  let rC := closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hC)
  -- The stalk of the twist of `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` at `η` has length at most one.
  have h1 : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η) ((G.obj ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
      (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))).presheaf.stalk η) ≤ 1 := by
    have e1 := length_stalk_eq_of_iso
      (E.unitIso.app (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) η
    have e2 := Scheme.IdealSheafData.length_stalk_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_of_mem_genericPoints
      (vanishingIdeal T) hy
    rw [hyη] at e2
    exact e1.symm.le.trans e2.le
  -- The twist of `𝒬` is nonzero at `η`.
  have hQ1 : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η) ((G.obj Q).presheaf.stalk η) ≠ 0 := by
    intro h0
    refine (length_stalk_eq_zero_iff Q η).mp
      ((length_stalk_eq_of_iso (E.counitIso.app Q) η).symm.trans ?_) hη
    exact (length_stalk_eq_zero_iff _ η).mpr (notMem_supp_tensorSheaf_of_notMem L (G.obj Q)
      ((length_stalk_eq_zero_iff _ η).mp h0))
  have : G.PreservesEpimorphisms :=
    Functor.preservesEpimorphisms_of_adjunction E.symm.toAdjunction
  have hGπ : Epi (G.map π) := G.map_epi π
  have hS := ShortComplex.shortExact_mk_kernel_ι (G.map π)
  have hadd := length_stalk_add_of_shortExact hS η
  have hK0 : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η) ((kernel (G.map π)).presheaf.stalk η) = 0 := by
    have h1' := hadd ▸ h1
    by_contra hne
    exact false_of_ne_zero_add_le_one hne hQ1 h1'
  -- The image of the twist of `g` vanishes at `η`.
  have hι : Abelian.image.ι (G.map g) ≫ G.map π = 0 := by
    refine (cancel_epi (Abelian.factorThruImage (G.map g))).mp ?_
    rw [← Category.assoc, Abelian.image.fac, ← G.map_comp, hg, G.map_zero, comp_zero]
  have : Mono (kernel.lift (G.map π) (Abelian.image.ι (G.map g)) hι) :=
    mono_of_mono_fac (kernel.lift_ι _ _ hι)
  have himg : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η)
      ((Abelian.image (G.map g)).presheaf.stalk η) = 0 :=
    le_antisymm ((length_stalk_le_of_mono (kernel.lift _ _ hι) η).trans hK0.le) bot_le
  -- Restricted to `C` it is a submodule of `𝒪_C` vanishing at the generic point, hence zero.
  let u : E.inverse.obj ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
      (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) ⟶
      closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T) :=
    E.unitInv.app (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))
  let v : closedSubschemeStructureSheaf
      (vanishingIdeal (⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ : Closeds X)) ⟶
      E.inverse.obj ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf
        (vanishingIdeal (⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ : Closeds X)))) :=
    E.unit.app (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf
      (vanishingIdeal (⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ : Closeds X)))
  let w := (E.inverse.map g ≫ u) ≫ rC
  have hw0 : Module.length (X.presheaf.stalk η) ((Abelian.image w).presheaf.stalk η) = 0 :=
    le_antisymm ((length_stalk_image_comp_le_left _ _ η).trans
      ((length_stalk_image_comp_le_left _ _ η).trans himg.le)) bot_le
  have hw : w = 0 := by
    by_contra hne
    have hIm : ¬ IsZero (Abelian.image w) := fun hz => hne (by
      rw [← Abelian.image.fac w, hz.eq_of_src (Abelian.image.ι w) 0, comp_zero])
    obtain ⟨y', hy', hsupp⟩ := Scheme.IdealSheafData.exists_mem_genericPoints_mem_supp
      (vanishingIdeal (⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ : Closeds X)) (Abelian.image.ι w) hIm
    rw [subschemeι_eq_of_mem_genericPoints hy'] at hsupp
    exact (length_stalk_eq_zero_iff _ η).mp hw0 hsupp
  -- Twisting back.
  have hinv : E.inverse.map ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map rC) = u ≫ rC ≫ v :=
    E.inv_fun_map _ _ rC
  have hfac : E.inverse.map g ≫ E.inverse.map ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map rC) =
      w ≫ v := by
    rw [hinv, ← Category.assoc, ← Category.assoc]
  refine E.inverse.map_injective ?_
  rw [E.inverse.map_comp, E.inverse.map_zero, hfac, hw, zero_comp]

/-! ### The cohomology of `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` -/

section Cohomology

variable {k : Type u} [Field k] (f : X ⟶ Spec (.of k)) [IsProper f]

/-- `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` is coherent. -/
theorem isCoherent_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf [IsLocallyNoetherian X]
    (L : X.Modules) [SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L]
    (Y : X.IdealSheafData) :
    ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf Y)).IsCoherent :=
  @SheafOfModules.tensorSheaf_isCoherent X.toRingedSpace L _
    (Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.CoherentKernel.isCoherent_of_isInvertible X L)
    (isCoherent_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf Y)

/-- **`χ(X, ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_Y) = χ(Y, ℒ|_Y)`** for a closed subscheme `Y`, by the projection formula. -/
theorem eulerCharacteristic_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (L : X.Modules)
    [SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (Y : X.IdealSheafData)
    (hC : ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf Y)).IsCoherent) :
    @eulerCharacteristic k _ X f _ _ hC =
      ∑ᶠ n : ℕ, (-1 : ℤ) ^ n * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k (Y.subschemeι ≫ f)
        ((Scheme.Modules.pullback Y.subschemeι).obj L) n) : ℤ) := by
  have : IsLocallyNoetherian X := LocallyOfFiniteType.isLocallyNoetherian f
  have hLc : L.IsCoherent := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.CoherentKernel.isCoherent_of_isInvertible X L
  have hOY := isCoherent_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf Y
  have hYloc : IsLocallyNoetherian Y.subscheme :=
    isLocallyNoetherian_of_isClosedImmersion Y.subschemeι
  have hunitY : (SheafOfModules.unit Y.subscheme.ringCatSheaf).IsCoherent :=
    Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.CoherentOfFiniteType.isCoherent_unit
  have hpull : ((Scheme.Modules.pullback Y.subschemeι).obj L).IsCoherent :=
    isCoherent_pullback Y.subschemeι L
  have hswap := Stacks.SheafOfModules.TensorPresentations.tensorSheafSwap X.toRingedSpace L
    (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf Y)
  rw [@eulerCharacteristic_eq_of_iso k _ X f _ _ _ hC
    (@SheafOfModules.tensorSheaf_isCoherent X.toRingedSpace _ L hOY hLc) hswap,
    eulerCharacteristic_tensorSheaf_pushforward_unit_of_isClosedImmersion k Y.subschemeι f L
      hLc hunitY hOY hpull, eulerCharacteristic_eq_finsum]

/-- **`h⁰(ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T) = deg(ℒ|_Y) + χ(Y, 𝒪_Y)` when `h¹(ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T) = 0`**, for `Y` the reduced
structure on a closed set `T` of dimension one: Riemann-Roch on `Y`, read on `X`. -/
theorem finrank_cohomologyOverField_zero_tensorLeft_closedSubscheme
    (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1) (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (T : Closeds X)
    (hY : topologicalKrullDim (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme = 1)
    (h1 : IsZero (cohomologyOverField k f
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) 1)) :
    letI := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.Tag09NY.isInvertible_modulePullback
      (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι L hL
    (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) 0) :
        ℤ) =
      invertibleCurveDegree k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f) hY.le
          ((Scheme.Modules.pullback (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι).obj L) +
        Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
          (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 0) -
        Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
          (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 1) := by
  let := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.Tag09NY.isInvertible_modulePullback
    (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι L hL
  have : IsLocallyNoetherian X := LocallyOfFiniteType.isLocallyNoetherian f
  have hC := isCoherent_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf L (vanishingIdeal T)
  have hχ := eulerCharacteristic_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf f L (vanishingIdeal T) hC
  rw [eulerCharacteristic_eq_finsum, finsum_alternating_finrank_cohomologyOverField_eq_sub_of_isZero
    _ _ _ (isZero_cohomologyOverField_two_le k f hdim _)] at hχ
  have h10 : Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
        (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) 1) = 0 :=
    have := ModuleCat.subsingleton_of_isZero h1
    Module.finrank_zero_of_subsingleton
  have hO := finsum_alternating_finrank_cohomologyOverField_eq_sub_of_isZero k
    ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
    (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf)
    (isZero_cohomologyOverField_two_le k _ hY.le _)
  unfold invertibleCurveDegree
  rw [← hχ, hO, h10]
  ring

/-- **Under the hypothesis, `H¹(X, ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T) = 0` for every closed set `T`.** A nonzero
map `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T ⟶ ω_X` would give, through
`AlgebraicGeometry.exists_le_invertibleCurveDegree_le_of_ne_zero` with the empty closed subscheme
in the role of `Z`, a connected closed `T'' ⊆ T` of dimension one with
`deg(ℒ|_{Y''}) ≤ -2 χ(Y'', 𝒪)`, while the hypothesis gives `-2 χ(Y'', 𝒪) < deg(ℒ|_{Y''})`. -/
theorem isZero_cohomologyOverField_one_tensorLeft_closedSubscheme
    (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1) (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L]
    (hyp : ∀ T : Closeds X, _root_.IsPreconnected (T : Set X) →
      ∀ hY : topologicalKrullDim (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme = 1,
        letI := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.Tag09NY.isInvertible_modulePullback
          (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι L hL
        2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 1) : ℤ) -
          2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 0) : ℤ) <
          invertibleCurveDegree k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f) hY.le
            ((Scheme.Modules.pullback (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι).obj L) ∧
        2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 1) : ℤ) <
          invertibleCurveDegree k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f) hY.le
            ((Scheme.Modules.pullback (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι).obj L) +
          (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 0) : ℤ))
    (T : Closeds X) :
    IsZero (cohomologyOverField k f
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
        (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) 1) := by
  have : IsLocallyNoetherian X := LocallyOfFiniteType.isLocallyNoetherian f
  have := isEquivalence_tensorLeft_of_isInvertible L
  have hRc := isCoherent_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf L (vanishingIdeal T)
  by_contra h
  obtain ⟨φ, hφ⟩ := Stacks.Duality.exists_ne_zero_hom_dualizingSheaf f hdim _
    (isQuasicoherent_of_isCoherent _) h
  have hz : ambientToClosedSubscheme (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData) = 0 :=
    isZero_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_top.eq_of_tgt _ _
  have hι : Epi (kernel.ι (ambientToClosedSubscheme (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData))) := by
    refine Preadditive.epi_of_cancel_zero _ fun {W} g hg => ?_
    have hl : kernel.lift (ambientToClosedSubscheme (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData)) (𝟙 _)
        (by rw [hz, comp_zero]) ≫ kernel.ι _ = 𝟙 _ := kernel.lift_ι _ _ _
    rw [← Category.id_comp g, ← hl, Category.assoc, hg, comp_zero]
  have hβ : Epi (idealToClosedSubscheme (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData) (vanishingIdeal T)) := by
    have := ambientToClosedSubscheme_epi (vanishingIdeal T)
    exact epi_comp _ _
  have hLβ : Epi ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map
      (idealToClosedSubscheme (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData) (vanishingIdeal T))) :=
    Functor.map_epi _ _
  have hZ : topologicalKrullDim (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData).subscheme ≤ 0 := by
    have : IsEmpty (IrreducibleCloseds (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData).subscheme) :=
      ⟨fun c => isEmptyElim c.isIrreducible.nonempty.some⟩
    have h1 : topologicalKrullDim (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData).subscheme = ⊥ := Order.krullDim_eq_bot
    rw [h1]
    exact bot_le
  obtain ⟨T'', -, hT''c, hY1, hYconn, hdeg⟩ := exists_le_invertibleCurveDegree_le_of_ne_zero f hdim
    L ⊤ hZ T ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map
      (idealToClosedSubscheme (⊤ : X.IdealSheafData) (vanishingIdeal T)) ≫ φ)
    (fun h0 => hφ ((cancel_epi _).mp (h0.trans comp_zero.symm)))
    (by rw [← Category.assoc, ← Functor.map_comp, kernel.condition, Functor.map_zero, zero_comp])
  have hle := (hyp T'' hT''c hY1).1
  let := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.Tag09NY.isInvertible_modulePullback
    (vanishingIdeal T'').subschemeι L hL
  let : Algebra k Γ(((⊤ : X.IdealSheafData) ⊔ vanishingIdeal T'').subscheme, ⊤) :=
    ((Scheme.ΓSpecIso (.of k)).inv ≫
      (((⊤ : X.IdealSheafData) ⊔ vanishingIdeal T'').subschemeι ≫ f).appTop).hom.toAlgebra
  have hE : IsEmpty ((⊤ : X.IdealSheafData) ⊔ vanishingIdeal T'').subscheme := by
    rw [top_sup_eq]; infer_instance
  have hΓ0 : Module.finrank k Γ(((⊤ : X.IdealSheafData) ⊔ vanishingIdeal T'').subscheme, ⊤) = 0 :=
    Module.finrank_zero_of_subsingleton
  have hO := finsum_alternating_finrank_cohomologyOverField_eq_sub_of_isZero k
    ((vanishingIdeal T'').subschemeι ≫ f)
    (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T'').subscheme.ringCatSheaf)
    (isZero_cohomologyOverField_two_le k _ hY1.le _)
  have hpos := finrank_cohomologyOverField_unit_zero_pos k ((vanishingIdeal T'').subschemeι ≫ f)
  rw [hO, hΓ0] at hdeg
  omega

end Cohomology

/-! ### The induction step -/

section Step

variable {k : Type u} [Field k] (f : X ⟶ Spec (.of k)) [IsProper f]

/-- `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_Y` is a direct image from `Y`. -/
theorem essImage_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (L : X.Modules)
    [SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (Y : X.IdealSheafData) :
    (Scheme.Modules.pushforward Y.subschemeι).essImage
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf Y)) :=
  ⟨_, ⟨(Stacks.AffineProjectionFormula.closedImmersionProjectionFormulaIso Y.subschemeι
    (SheafOfModules.unit Y.subscheme.ringCatSheaf)
    L).symm ≪≫ Stacks.SheafOfModules.TensorPresentations.tensorSheafSwap X.toRingedSpace _ L⟩⟩

/-- Restriction between nested closed subschemes is an epimorphism. -/
theorem epi_closedSubschemeRestriction {I J : X.IdealSheafData} (h : I ≤ J) :
    Epi (closedSubschemeRestriction h) := by
  have := ambientToClosedSubscheme_epi J
  exact epi_of_epi_fac (ambientToClosedSubscheme_comp_closedSubschemeRestriction h)

/-- **No map from a large submodule of `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` to `ω_X` is injective**: a submodule `ℳ` with
`h⁰(ℳ) ≥ h⁰(ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T) = deg(ℒ|_T) + χ(𝒪_T) > h¹(𝒪_T)`, by the hypothesis on `T`, while an
injective map into `ω_X` forces `h⁰(ℳ) ≤ h¹(𝒪_T)`. -/
theorem not_mono_of_finrank_le (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1) (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (T : Closeds X)
    (hY : topologicalKrullDim (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme = 1)
    (hdeg :
      letI := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.Tag09NY.isInvertible_modulePullback
        (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι L hL
      2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
          (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 1) : ℤ) <
        invertibleCurveDegree k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f) hY.le
          ((Scheme.Modules.pullback (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι).obj L) +
        (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
          (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 0) : ℤ))
    (hH1 : IsZero (cohomologyOverField k f
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) 1))
    {M : X.Modules}
    (j : M ⟶ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))
    [Mono j]
    (hM : Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) 0) ≤
        Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f M 0))
    (φ : M ⟶ Stacks.Duality.dualizingSheafOverField f) : ¬ Mono φ := by
  intro hφ
  have hR0 := finrank_cohomologyOverField_zero_tensorLeft_closedSubscheme f hdim L T hY hH1
  have hYne : Nonempty (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme := by
    by_contra hne
    rw [not_nonempty_iff] at hne
    have : IsEmpty (TopologicalSpace.IrreducibleCloseds (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme) :=
      ⟨fun c => hne.elim c.isIrreducible.nonempty.some⟩
    have h1 : topologicalKrullDim (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme = ⊥ := Order.krullDim_eq_bot
    rw [h1] at hY
    exact absurd hY (by decide)
  have hpos := finrank_cohomologyOverField_unit_zero_pos k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
  have hess := essImage_pushforward_of_mono (vanishingIdeal T) j
    (essImage_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf L (vanishingIdeal T))
  have := @finrank_cohomologyOverField_zero_le_of_mono_dualizingSheaf X k _ f _ hdim
    (vanishingIdeal T) _ hess φ hφ
  omega

/-- **For `k` infinite, a single component carries the kernel of every map `ℳ ⟶ ω_X`**, when no
such map is injective: each lies in one of finitely many proper subspaces
(`AlgebraicGeometry.exists_mem_genericPoints_kernel_ι_comp_eq_zero`), and a vector space over an
infinite field is not a finite union of proper subspaces. -/
theorem exists_mem_genericPoints_forall_kernel_ι_comp_eq_zero [Infinite k]
    (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1) (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (T : Closeds X)
    {M : X.Modules} (hMc : M.IsCoherent)
    (j : M ⟶ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))
    [Mono j] (hnm : ∀ φ : M ⟶ Stacks.Duality.dualizingSheafOverField f, ¬ Mono φ) :
    ∃ y : genericPoints (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme,
      ∀ φ : M ⟶ Stacks.Duality.dualizingSheafOverField f,
        kernel.ι (j ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (closedSubschemeRestriction
          (vanishingIdeal_antimono (T.closureDiffClosure_le ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y.1)))))
          ≫ φ = 0 := by
  have : IsLocallyNoetherian X := LocallyOfFiniteType.isLocallyNoetherian f
  have : IsNoetherian X := isNoetherian_of_locallyOfFiniteType f
  have : NoetherianSpace (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme :=
    (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι.isClosedEmbedding.isInducing.noetherianSpace
  have : Finite (genericPoints (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme) :=
    (genericPoints.finite (NoetherianSpace.finite_irreducibleComponents)).to_subtype
  exact exists_forall_comp_eq_zero_of_forall_exists f _ fun φ =>
    exists_mem_genericPoints_kernel_ι_comp_eq_zero f hdim L T hMc j φ (hnm φ)

/-- **`h¹(ℳ) ≤ h⁰(𝒬')`, strictly if `𝒬' ≠ 0`**, for a map `ρ : ℳ ⟶ ℛ'` through whose coimage
every map `ℳ ⟶ ω_X` factors, where `ℛ'` is globally generated with `H¹(ℛ') = 0` and `𝒬'` is the
cokernel of the coimage. Duality gives `h¹(ℳ) ≤ h¹(coim ρ)`, and the long exact sequence of
`0 ⟶ coim ρ ⟶ ℛ' ⟶ 𝒬' ⟶ 0` compares `h¹(coim ρ)` with `h⁰(𝒬')`. -/
theorem finrank_one_le_of_forall_kernel_ι_comp_eq_zero (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1)
    {M R' : X.Modules} (hMc : M.IsCoherent) (hR'c : R'.IsCoherent) (ρ : M ⟶ R')
    (hall : ∀ φ : M ⟶ Stacks.Duality.dualizingSheafOverField f, kernel.ι ρ ≫ φ = 0)
    (hH1 : IsZero (cohomologyOverField k f R' 1)) :
    Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f M 1) ≤
        Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f (cokernel (Abelian.factorThruCoimage ρ)) 0) ∧
      (Epi (globalSectionsHom R') → ¬ IsZero (cokernel (Abelian.factorThruCoimage ρ)) →
        Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f M 1) <
          Module.finrank k
            (cohomologyOverField k f (cokernel (Abelian.factorThruCoimage ρ)) 0)) := by
  have : IsLocallyNoetherian X := LocallyOfFiniteType.isLocallyNoetherian f
  let := modulesLinearOverField k f
  have hMηc : (Abelian.coimage ρ).IsCoherent := isCoherent_coimage hMc hR'c ρ
  have hQηc : (cokernel (Abelian.factorThruCoimage ρ)).IsCoherent :=
    Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProperMapping.isCoherent_cokernel_modules hMηc hR'c _
  have hHom : ∀ (F : X.Modules), F.IsCoherent →
      Module.finrank k (F ⟶ Stacks.Duality.dualizingSheafOverField f) =
        Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f F 1) := fun F hF => by
    have := @finiteDimensional_cohomologyOverField_of_isProper k _ X f _ F hF 1
    rw [(Stacks.Duality.homDualizingSheafLinearEquiv f hdim F
      (@isQuasicoherent_of_isCoherent _ _ _ F hF)).finrank_eq, Subspace.dual_finrank_eq]
  have hfinHom : FiniteDimensional k
      (Abelian.coimage ρ ⟶ Stacks.Duality.dualizingSheafOverField f) := by
    have := @finiteDimensional_cohomologyOverField_of_isProper k _ X f _ _ hMηc 1
    exact LinearEquiv.finiteDimensional (Stacks.Duality.homDualizingSheafLinearEquiv f hdim _
      (@isQuasicoherent_of_isCoherent _ _ _ _ hMηc)).symm
  have hsurj : Function.Surjective (Linear.leftComp k (Stacks.Duality.dualizingSheafOverField f)
      (Abelian.coimage.π ρ)) := fun φ =>
    ⟨cokernel.desc (kernel.ι ρ) φ (hall φ), cokernel.π_desc (kernel.ι ρ) φ (hall φ)⟩
  have hM1 := LinearMap.finrank_le_finrank_of_surjective hsurj
  rw [hHom _ hMc, hHom _ hMηc] at hM1
  have hS2 : (ShortComplex.mk (Abelian.factorThruCoimage ρ)
      (cokernel.π (Abelian.factorThruCoimage ρ)) (cokernel.condition _)).ShortExact :=
    ShortComplex.ShortExact.mk' (ShortComplex.exact_cokernel _) inferInstance inferInstance
  obtain ⟨h2a, h2b⟩ := finrank_one_le_finrank_zero_of_shortExact f hS2 hQηc hH1
  dsimp only at h2a h2b
  exact ⟨hM1.trans h2a, fun hR hQ => lt_of_le_of_lt hM1 (h2b hR hQ)⟩

/-- **A quotient of `ℛ` supported in dimension zero has at least as many sections as the
induced quotient of a quotient `ℛ'` of `ℛ`.** For `π : ℛ ⟶ 𝒬` and `r : ℛ ⟶ ℛ'` epimorphisms,
`𝒬' = ℛ' / r(ker π)` is a quotient of `𝒬`, with kernel supported in dimension zero. -/
theorem finrank_zero_cokernel_le {R R' Q : X.Modules} (π : R ⟶ Q) [Epi π] (r : R ⟶ R') [Epi r]
    (hQc : Q.IsCoherent) (hQ : topologicalKrullDim (_root_.SheafOfModules.supp Q) ≤ 0)
    (hQηc : (cokernel (Abelian.factorThruCoimage (kernel.ι π ≫ r))).IsCoherent) :
    Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f
        (cokernel (Abelian.factorThruCoimage (kernel.ι π ≫ r))) 0) ≤
      Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f Q 0) := by
  have hπ'0 : kernel.ι π ≫ (r ≫ cokernel.π (Abelian.factorThruCoimage (kernel.ι π ≫ r))) = 0 := by
    calc kernel.ι π ≫ (r ≫ cokernel.π (Abelian.factorThruCoimage (kernel.ι π ≫ r)))
        = (kernel.ι π ≫ r) ≫ cokernel.π (Abelian.factorThruCoimage (kernel.ι π ≫ r)) :=
          (Category.assoc _ _ _).symm
      _ = (Abelian.coimage.π _ ≫ Abelian.factorThruCoimage (kernel.ι π ≫ r)) ≫
          cokernel.π (Abelian.factorThruCoimage (kernel.ι π ≫ r)) := by rw [Abelian.coimage.fac]
      _ = 0 := by rw [Category.assoc, cokernel.condition, comp_zero]
  have hc : π ≫ Abelian.epiDesc π _ hπ'0 =
      r ≫ cokernel.π (Abelian.factorThruCoimage (kernel.ι π ≫ r)) := Abelian.comp_epiDesc _ _ _
  have : Epi (π ≫ Abelian.epiDesc π _ hπ'0) := by rw [hc]; exact epi_comp _ _
  have : Epi (Abelian.epiDesc π _ hπ'0) := epi_of_epi π _
  exact finrank_zero_le_of_epi_of_supp_le_zero f hQc hQηc (Abelian.epiDesc π _ hπ'0) hQ

omit [IsProper f] in
/-- The zero module has no global sections. -/
theorem finrank_cohomologyOverField_zero_eq_zero_of_isZero {F : X.Modules} (h : IsZero F) :
    Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f F 0) = 0 := by
  have : Subsingleton Γ(F, ⊤) := ⟨fun a b => (section_eq_zero_of_isZero h a).trans
    (section_eq_zero_of_isZero h b).symm⟩
  have := (cohomologyOverFieldZeroEquivSections k f F).subsingleton
  exact Module.finrank_zero_of_subsingleton

/-- **The induction step of [Stacks, Tag 0E3F].** Let `T` be a connected closed set of dimension
one satisfying `h¹(𝒪_T) < deg(ℒ|_T) + χ(𝒪_T)`, such that `H¹(ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_{T'}) = 0` for all closed `T'`
and `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_{T'}` is globally generated for all `T' ⊊ T`, and let `k` be infinite. Then a quotient
`𝒬` of `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` supported in dimension zero, in which every global section dies, is zero. -/
theorem isZero_of_epi_of_globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero [Infinite k]
    (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1) (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (T : Closeds X)
    (hY : topologicalKrullDim (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme = 1)
    (hdeg :
      letI := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.Tag09NY.isInvertible_modulePullback
        (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι L hL
      2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
          (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 1) : ℤ) <
        invertibleCurveDegree k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f) hY.le
          ((Scheme.Modules.pullback (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι).obj L) +
        (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
          (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 0) : ℤ))
    (hH1 : ∀ T' : Closeds X, IsZero (cohomologyOverField k f
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T'))) 1))
    (ih : ∀ T' < T, Epi (globalSectionsHom
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T')))))
    {Q : X.Modules} (hQc : Q.IsCoherent)
    (π : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)) ⟶ Q)
    [Epi π] (hγ : globalSectionsHom _ ≫ π = 0)
    (hQ : topologicalKrullDim (_root_.SheafOfModules.supp Q) ≤ 0) : IsZero Q := by
  have : IsLocallyNoetherian X := LocallyOfFiniteType.isLocallyNoetherian f
  have := isEquivalence_tensorLeft_of_isInvertible L
  have hRc := isCoherent_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf L (vanishingIdeal T)
  have hMc : (kernel π).IsCoherent :=
    Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProperMapping.isCoherent_kernel_modules hRc hQc π
  have hS := ShortComplex.shortExact_mk_kernel_ι π
  have hQM := finrank_zero_le_finrank_one_of_shortExact f hS hMc hγ
  have hRM := finrank_zero_le_finrank_zero_of_shortExact f hS hMc hγ
  dsimp only at hQM hRM
  have : IsNoetherian X := isNoetherian_of_locallyOfFiniteType f
  have : NoetherianSpace (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme :=
    (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι.isClosedEmbedding.isInducing.noetherianSpace
  obtain ⟨y, hall⟩ := exists_mem_genericPoints_forall_kernel_ι_comp_eq_zero f hdim L T hMc
    (kernel.ι π) (not_mono_of_finrank_le f hdim L T hY hdeg (hH1 T) (kernel.ι π) hRM)
  have hT'lt : T.closureDiffClosure ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y.1) < T := by
    refine lt_of_le_of_ne (T.closureDiffClosure_le _) fun h => ?_
    have hηT' := (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι.isClosedEmbedding.notMem_closure_range_diff y.2
    rw [range_subschemeι, coe_support_vanishingIdeal] at hηT'
    have hηT := subschemeι_mem_of_vanishingIdeal y.1
    have : (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y.1 ∈
        (T.closureDiffClosure ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y.1) : Set X) := by
      rw [h]; exact hηT
    exact hηT' this
  have hRc' := isCoherent_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf L
    (vanishingIdeal (T.closureDiffClosure ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y.1)))
  obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := finrank_one_le_of_forall_kernel_ι_comp_eq_zero f hdim hMc hRc' _ hall
    (hH1 _)
  have := epi_closedSubschemeRestriction
    (vanishingIdeal_antimono (T.closureDiffClosure_le ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y.1)))
  have hr : Epi ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (closedSubschemeRestriction
      (vanishingIdeal_antimono (T.closureDiffClosure_le ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y.1))))) :=
    Functor.map_epi _ _
  have hQηc := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProperMapping.isCoherent_cokernel_modules
    (isCoherent_coimage hMc hRc' (kernel.ι π ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map
      (closedSubschemeRestriction
        (vanishingIdeal_antimono (T.closureDiffClosure_le ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y.1))))))
    hRc' (Abelian.factorThruCoimage _)
  have hQQ := finrank_zero_cokernel_le f π _ hQc hQ hQηc
  refine isZero_of_isZero_cohomologyOverField_zero_of_supp_dim_le_zero f hQc hQ ?_
  have := finiteDimensional_cohomologyOverField_of_isProper k f Q 0
  suffices h0 : Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k f Q 0) = 0 by
    have : Subsingleton (cohomologyOverField k f Q 0) := Module.finrank_zero_iff.mp h0
    exact ModuleCat.isZero_of_subsingleton _
  by_cases hQη : IsZero (cokernel (Abelian.factorThruCoimage (kernel.ι π ≫
    (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (closedSubschemeRestriction
      (vanishingIdeal_antimono (T.closureDiffClosure_le ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y.1)))))))
  · have h0 := finrank_cohomologyOverField_zero_eq_zero_of_isZero f hQη
    omega
  · have := h2 (ih _ hT'lt) hQη
    omega

end Step

/-! ### Global generation of `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` -/

/-- A subsingleton space has Krull dimension at most zero. -/
theorem topologicalKrullDim_nonpos_of_subsingleton {α : Type*} [TopologicalSpace α]
    [Subsingleton α] : topologicalKrullDim α ≤ 0 :=
  have : Subsingleton (IrreducibleCloseds α) := ⟨fun T T' ↦ IrreducibleCloseds.ext <| by
    have h : ∀ s : Set α, s.Nonempty → s = Set.univ := fun s ⟨y, hy⟩ ↦
      Set.eq_univ_of_forall fun x ↦ Subsingleton.elim y x ▸ hy
    rw [h _ T.isIrreducible.nonempty, h _ T'.isIrreducible.nonempty]⟩
  Order.krullDim_nonpos_of_subsingleton

/-- A zero module has empty support. -/
theorem notMem_supp_of_isZero {F : X.Modules} (h : IsZero F) (x : X) :
    x ∉ _root_.SheafOfModules.supp F := by
  rintro ⟨a, ha⟩
  obtain ⟨U, hxU, s, rfl⟩ := TopCat.Presheaf.exists_germ_eq F.presheaf a
  exact ha (by rw [section_eq_zero_of_isZero h s]; exact map_zero _)

/-- **The disconnected case**: for `T` the disjoint union of `T₁` and `T₂`, the module
`ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T = (ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_{T₁}) ⊕ (ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_{T₂})` is globally generated when both summands are. -/
theorem epi_globalSectionsHom_tensorLeft_of_disjoint (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] {T T₁ T₂ : Closeds X}
    (h₁ : T₁ ≤ T) (h₂ : T₂ ≤ T) (hT : T ≤ T₁ ⊔ T₂) (hd : Disjoint (T₁ : Set X) T₂)
    (hg₁ : Epi (globalSectionsHom
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T₁)))))
    (hg₂ : Epi (globalSectionsHom
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T₂))))) :
    Epi (globalSectionsHom
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))) := by
  have := isEquivalence_tensorLeft_of_isInvertible L
  have : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).Additive := Functor.additive_of_preserves_binary_products _
  let r₁ := closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono h₁)
  let r₂ := closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono h₂)
  have hiso : IsIso (biprod.lift r₁ r₂) := isIso_biprodLift_closedSubschemeRestriction _ _
    (by rw [← vanishingIdeal_sup]; exact vanishingIdeal_antimono hT)
    (vanishingIdeal_sup_eq_top_of_disjoint hd)
  let e := asIso (biprod.lift r₁ r₂)
  refine epi_globalSectionsHom_of_jointly_epi
    ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (biprod.inl ≫ e.inv))
    ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (biprod.inr ≫ e.inv)) hg₁ hg₂ fun {W} h hp hq => ?_
  have hp' : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map biprod.inl ≫
      (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map e.inv ≫ h = 0 := by
    rw [← Category.assoc, ← Functor.map_comp]; exact hp
  have hq' : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map biprod.inr ≫
      (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map e.inv ≫ h = 0 := by
    rw [← Category.assoc, ← Functor.map_comp]; exact hq
  have htot : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (𝟙 (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf
      (vanishingIdeal T₁) ⊞ closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T₂))) =
      (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map biprod.fst ≫ (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map biprod.inl +
        (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map biprod.snd ≫
          (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map biprod.inr := by
    rw [← Functor.map_comp, ← Functor.map_comp, ← Functor.map_add, biprod.total]
  have h1 : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map e.inv ≫ h = 0 := by
    calc (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map e.inv ≫ h
        = (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (𝟙 _) ≫
            (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map e.inv ≫ h := by
          rw [CategoryTheory.Functor.map_id, Category.id_comp]
      _ = 0 := by
          rw [htot, Preadditive.add_comp, Category.assoc, Category.assoc, hp', hq', comp_zero,
            comp_zero, add_zero]
  calc h = (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (e.hom ≫ e.inv) ≫ h := by
        rw [e.hom_inv_id, CategoryTheory.Functor.map_id, Category.id_comp]
    _ = 0 := by rw [Functor.map_comp, Category.assoc, h1, comp_zero]

/-- **The module `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_x` at a closed point `x` is nonzero, coherent and supported at `x`.** -/
theorem tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_singleton [IsLocallyNoetherian X] (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] {x : X}
    (hx : IsClosed ({x} : Set X)) :
    ¬ IsZero ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
        (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal (⟨{x}, hx⟩ : Closeds X)))) ∧
      topologicalKrullDim (_root_.SheafOfModules.supp ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
        (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal (⟨{x}, hx⟩ : Closeds X))))) ≤ 0 := by
  have := isEquivalence_tensorLeft_of_isInvertible L
  have hPsupp := supp_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_subset L (⟨{x}, hx⟩ : Closeds X)
  refine ⟨fun hz => ?_, ?_⟩
  · have hz' : IsZero (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal (⟨{x}, hx⟩ : Closeds X))) :=
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).asEquivalence.inverse.map_isZero hz).of_iso
        ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).asEquivalence.unitIso.app _)
    refine notMem_supp_of_isZero hz' x ?_
    rw [supp_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf, coe_support_vanishingIdeal]
    exact Set.mem_singleton x
  · have : Subsingleton (_root_.SheafOfModules.supp ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
        (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal (⟨{x}, hx⟩ : Closeds X))))) :=
      ⟨fun a b => Subtype.ext ((hPsupp a.2).trans (hPsupp b.2).symm)⟩
    exact topologicalKrullDim_nonpos_of_subsingleton

/-- **If the global sections of `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` all vanish on the component of a generic point `η` of
`T`, they all die in `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_x` for some closed point `x` of that component.** -/
theorem exists_isClosed_singleton_globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero [IsNoetherian X] (L : X.Modules)
    [SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L] (T : Closeds X)
    {η : X} (hCT : (⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ : Closeds X) ≤ T)
    (hvan : globalSectionsHom ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
        (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) ≫
      (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hCT))
        = 0) :
    ∃ (x : X) (hx : IsClosed ({x} : Set X))
      (hxC : (⟨{x}, hx⟩ : Closeds X) ≤ ⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩),
      globalSectionsHom ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
        (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))) ≫
      (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map (closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hCT) ≫
        closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hxC)) = 0 := by
  obtain ⟨x, hxC, hxcl⟩ := (isClosed_closure : IsClosed (closure {η})).exists_closed_singleton
    ⟨_, subset_closure rfl⟩
  have hPC : (⟨{x}, hxcl⟩ : Closeds X) ≤ ⟨closure {η}, isClosed_closure⟩ :=
    Set.singleton_subset_iff.mpr hxC
  refine ⟨x, hxcl, hPC, ?_⟩
  rw [Functor.map_comp, ← Category.assoc, hvan, zero_comp]

section Induction

variable {k : Type u} [Field k] (f : X ⟶ Spec (.of k)) [IsProper f]

/-- **Under the hypothesis, and for `k` infinite, `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_T` is generated by global
sections for every closed set `T`**, by Noetherian induction on `T`. A zero-dimensional `T` is
[Stacks, Tag 0AYT]; a disconnected `T` splits as a disjoint union of smaller closed sets. For a
connected `T` of dimension one, the cokernel `𝒬` of the global sections is zero by
`AlgebraicGeometry.isZero_of_epi_of_globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero` if it is supported in
dimension zero; otherwise all global sections vanish on a component `C` of `T`
(`AlgebraicGeometry.comp_tensorLeft_map_restriction_eq_zero`), so they die in `ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_x` for a
closed point `x ∈ C`, and the same lemma applied to that nonzero quotient gives a contradiction. -/
theorem epi_globalSectionsHom_tensorLeft_closedSubscheme [Infinite k]
    (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1) (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L]
    (hyp : ∀ T : Closeds X, _root_.IsPreconnected (T : Set X) →
      ∀ hY : topologicalKrullDim (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme = 1,
        letI := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.Tag09NY.isInvertible_modulePullback
          (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι L hL
        2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 1) : ℤ) -
          2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 0) : ℤ) <
          invertibleCurveDegree k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f) hY.le
            ((Scheme.Modules.pullback (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι).obj L) ∧
        2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 1) : ℤ) <
          invertibleCurveDegree k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f) hY.le
            ((Scheme.Modules.pullback (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι).obj L) +
          (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 0) : ℤ))
    (T : Closeds X) :
    Epi (globalSectionsHom
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))) := by
  have : IsLocallyNoetherian X := LocallyOfFiniteType.isLocallyNoetherian f
  have : IsNoetherian X := isNoetherian_of_locallyOfFiniteType f
  have := isEquivalence_tensorLeft_of_isInvertible L
  have hH1 := isZero_cohomologyOverField_one_tensorLeft_closedSubscheme f hdim L hyp
  induction T using WellFoundedLT.induction with
  | ind T ih =>
  have hRc := isCoherent_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf L (vanishingIdeal T)
  have hsuppR := supp_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_subset L T
  by_cases h0 : topologicalKrullDim (T : Set X) ≤ 0
  · have := hRc
    obtain ⟨σ⟩ := nonempty_generatingSections_of_support_dim_le_zero _
      (((Topology.IsEmbedding.inclusion hsuppR).isInducing.topologicalKrullDim_le).trans h0)
    exact epi_globalSectionsHom_of_generatingSections σ
  by_cases hc : _root_.IsPreconnected (T : Set X)
  · have hY : topologicalKrullDim (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme = 1 := by
      rw [← Scheme.IdealSheafData.topologicalKrullDim_support, coe_support_vanishingIdeal]
      exact WithBot.eq_one_of_le_one_of_not_le_zero
        ((topologicalKrullDim_subspace_le X T).trans hdim) h0
    have hdeg := (hyp T hc hY).2
    have := @isQuasicoherent_of_isCoherent _ _ _ _ hRc
    have hQc : (cokernel (globalSectionsHom ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
        (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T))))).IsCoherent :=
      Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.CoherentOfFiniteType.isCoherent_of_epi_of_isQuasicoherent hRc
        (cokernel.π _)
    refine epi_of_isZero_cokernel _ ?_
    by_cases hQd : topologicalKrullDim (_root_.SheafOfModules.supp (cokernel (globalSectionsHom
        ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
          (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))))) ≤ 0
    · exact isZero_of_epi_of_globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero f hdim L T hY hdeg hH1 ih hQc
        (cokernel.π (globalSectionsHom ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
          (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))))
        (cokernel.condition _) hQd
    exfalso
    have hcl : IsClosed (_root_.SheafOfModules.supp (cokernel (globalSectionsHom
        ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))))) :=
      @_root_.SheafOfModules.isClosed_supp _ _ _ hQc.isFiniteType
    have hsubT := (Stacks.Chow.supp_subset_of_epi (cokernel.π (globalSectionsHom
      ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
          (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))))).trans hsuppR
    obtain ⟨y, hy, hyS⟩ := exists_mem_genericPoints_subschemeι_mem hdim T hcl hsubT hQd
    have hCT : (⟨closure {(vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι y}, isClosed_closure⟩ : Closeds X) ≤ T :=
      closure_minimal (Set.singleton_subset_iff.mpr (hsubT hyS)) T.isClosed
    have hvan := comp_tensorLeft_map_restriction_eq_zero L T hy rfl hCT (cokernel.π
      (globalSectionsHom ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
          (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal T)))))
      hyS _ (cokernel.condition _)
    obtain ⟨x, hx, hxC, hγπ⟩ :=
      exists_isClosed_singleton_globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero L T hCT hvan
    obtain ⟨hne, hPd⟩ := tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf_singleton L hx
    have := epi_closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hCT)
    have := epi_closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hxC)
    have hπ : Epi ((Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).map
        (closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hCT) ≫
          closedSubschemeRestriction (vanishingIdeal_antimono hxC))) := Functor.map_epi _ _
    exact hne (isZero_of_epi_of_globalSectionsHom_comp_eq_zero f hdim L T hY hdeg hH1 ih
      (isCoherent_tensorLeft_closedSubschemeStructureSheaf L _) _ hγπ hPd)
  · rw [isPreconnected_closed_iff] at hc
    push Not at hc
    obtain ⟨t, t', ht, ht', hcov, ⟨a, haT, hat⟩, ⟨b, hbT, hbt'⟩, hempty⟩ := hc
    let T₁ : Closeds X := ⟨T ∩ t, T.isClosed.inter ht⟩
    let T₂ : Closeds X := ⟨T ∩ t', T.isClosed.inter ht'⟩
    have hd : Disjoint (T₁ : Set X) T₂ := by
      rw [Set.disjoint_iff_inter_eq_empty, ← Set.not_nonempty_iff_eq_empty]
      rintro ⟨z, ⟨hzT, hzt⟩, -, hzt'⟩
      exact Set.eq_empty_iff_forall_notMem.mp hempty z ⟨hzT, hzt, hzt'⟩
    have hT : T ≤ T₁ ⊔ T₂ := fun z hz => (hcov hz).elim (fun h => Or.inl ⟨hz, h⟩)
      (fun h => Or.inr ⟨hz, h⟩)
    have hlt₁ : T₁ < T := by
      refine lt_of_le_of_ne (fun z hz => hz.1) fun h => ?_
      have hb : b ∈ (T₁ : Set X) := h ▸ hbT
      exact Set.eq_empty_iff_forall_notMem.mp hempty b ⟨hbT, hb.2, hbt'⟩
    have hlt₂ : T₂ < T := by
      refine lt_of_le_of_ne (fun z hz => hz.1) fun h => ?_
      have ha : a ∈ (T₂ : Set X) := h ▸ haT
      exact Set.eq_empty_iff_forall_notMem.mp hempty a ⟨haT, hat, ha.2⟩
    exact epi_globalSectionsHom_tensorLeft_of_disjoint L hlt₁.le hlt₂.le hT hd (ih _ hlt₁)
      (ih _ hlt₂)

/-- **[Stacks, Tag 0E3F] over an infinite field.** Let `X` be a proper reduced scheme of
dimension at most one over an infinite field `k` and `ℒ` an invertible `𝒪_X`-module with
`-2 χ(Y, 𝒪_Y) < deg(ℒ|_Y)` and `h¹(Y, 𝒪_Y) < deg(ℒ|_Y) + χ(Y, 𝒪_Y)` for the reduced structure `Y`
on every connected closed subset of dimension one. Then `ℒ` is globally generated: it is
`ℒ ⊗ 𝒪_X`, and `𝒪_X` is the structure sheaf of the reduced structure on `X`. -/
theorem isGeneratedByGlobalSections_of_infinite [Infinite k] [IsReduced X]
    (hdim : topologicalKrullDim X ≤ 1) (L : X.Modules)
    [hL : SheafOfModules.IsInvertible X.presheaf X.ringCatSheaf.2 L]
    (hyp : ∀ T : Closeds X, _root_.IsPreconnected (T : Set X) →
      ∀ hY : topologicalKrullDim (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme = 1,
        letI := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.Tag09NY.isInvertible_modulePullback
          (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι L hL
        2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 1) : ℤ) -
          2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 0) : ℤ) <
          invertibleCurveDegree k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f) hY.le
            ((Scheme.Modules.pullback (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι).obj L) ∧
        2 * (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 1) : ℤ) <
          invertibleCurveDegree k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f) hY.le
            ((Scheme.Modules.pullback (vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι).obj L) +
          (Module.finrank k (cohomologyOverField k ((vanishingIdeal T).subschemeι ≫ f)
            (SheafOfModules.unit (vanishingIdeal T).subscheme.ringCatSheaf) 0) : ℤ)) :
    _root_.SheafOfModules.IsGeneratedByGlobalSections L := by
  have hT := epi_globalSectionsHom_tensorLeft_closedSubscheme f hdim L hyp ⊤
  have h : vanishingIdeal (⊤ : Closeds X) = ⊥ := by
    rw [vanishingIdeal_top, Scheme.nilradical_eq_bot]
  have : IsIso (ambientToClosedSubscheme (vanishingIdeal (⊤ : Closeds X))) := by
    rw [h]; exact isIso_ambientToPushforward _
  let e₁ : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (ambientStructureSheaf X) ≅ L :=
    tensorSheafUnitRight X.toRingedSpace L
  let e₂ : (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj (ambientStructureSheaf X) ≅
      (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).obj
        (closedSubschemeStructureSheaf (vanishingIdeal (⊤ : Closeds X))) :=
    (Scheme.Modules.tensorLeft L).mapIso (asIso (ambientToClosedSubscheme _))
  exact nonempty_generatingSections_of_epi_globalSectionsHom L
    (epi_globalSectionsHom_of_epi (e₂.inv ≫ e₁.hom) hT)

end Induction

